- ### Formulas and equations
+ ### Fórmulas y ecuaciones

- A molecule with a coefficient is a term of a formula. Terms are added with `+`, and two
- formulas are joined into an equation with a reaction arrow:
+ Una molécula con un coeficiente es un término de una fórmula. Los términos se suman con `+`, y dos
+ fórmulas se unen en una ecuación con una flecha de reacción:

= formulas are joined into an equation with a reaction arrow:
=
- ```scala
+ ```scala

- val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2
+ val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2

= val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2
- ```
+ ```

= val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2
= ```
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2
= ```
=
= ```scala fuel
- run
+ run

= val combustion = H[2]*2 + O[2] --> H[2]*O*2
= ```
=
= ```scala fuel
= run
