+ ```

- An equation knows whether its two sides contain the same atoms:
+ Una ecuación sabe si sus dos miembros contienen los mismos átomos:

= An equation knows whether its two sides contain the same atoms:
=
- ```scala fuel
+ ```scala fuel

= An equation knows whether its two sides contain the same atoms:
